{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/extras/Unserious_Sandbox.jpg?t=1747447542\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unserious Sandbox</strong> is a physics sandbox, an abstract space just for fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Desktop Wallpaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game makes a good wallpaper!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Parkour</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The current gameplay of Unserious Sandbox centers around player movements. Roam free, experiment with different moves, and explore various routes. Be aware! The parkour may look easy, but skills definitely take time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ragdoll Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On-demand ragdoll physics simulation in sandbox maps. Embrace the chaos and master the art of falling flat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beyond Sandbox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unserious Sandbox, this game itself, is a sandbox with an unserious Sandbox\u2014not just the sandbox, but also the character. More than just a game, Unserious Sandbox is also an idea and a concept, all began with just one simple and childish dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/extras/redmaple.png?t=1747447542\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391340?t=1747447542","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3391340?t=1747447542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/fcf20a31e65f8d7a2fee6f8776240f8d2dd44e00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747447542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/fcf20a31e65f8d7a2fee6f8776240f8d2dd44e00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747447542","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},